              "content": "Initiates a Bulk Data (Flat FHIR) export for a Group of patients per\nHL7 FHIR Bulk Data Access IG. Requires client_credentials authentication and the\n`system/*.read` scope. Status is polled at the Content-Location URL.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
